reat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability.\" title=\"An imbalance in the poppability.\">An imbalance in the poppability.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oatmeal_and_death.\" title=\"Oatmeal and death.\">Oatmeal and death.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The end of the franchise.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_customised_inhaler.\" title=\"The customised inhaler.\">The customised inhaler.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Croissants_is_croissants.\" title=\"Croissants is croissants.\">Croissants is croissants.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_chair_in_a_sweet.\" title=\"A chair in a sweet.\">A chair in a sweet.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_integrity_of_the_product.\" title=\"The integrity of the product.\">The integrity of the product.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_couple_of_Ethels.\" title=\"A couple of Ethels.\">A couple of Ethels.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nothing_matters.\" title=\"Nothing matters.\">Nothing matters.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caring_Uncle_Minpict.\" title=\"Caring Uncle Minpict.\">Caring Uncle Minpict.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The end of the franchise.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/fc/The_end_of_the_franchise..png/revision/latest?cb=20211007221251\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The end of the franchise.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/fc/The_end_of_the_franchise..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211007221251\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/fc/The_end_of_the_franchise..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211007221251 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/fc/The_end_of_the_franchise..png/revision/latest?cb=20211007221251 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The end of the franchise.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_end_of_the_franchise..png\" data-image-name=\"The end of the franchise..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">12</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\">Desiree Burch</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oatmeal_and_death.\" title=\"Oatmeal and death.\">Oatmeal and death.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_customised_inhaler.\" title=\"The customised inhaler.\">The customised inhaler.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The end of the franchise.</b></i> was the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">Series 12</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 7 October 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\">Desiree Burch</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_end_of_the_franchise.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"The end of the franchise\" was what <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> thought would happen if <a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</a>'s idea for a Bond movie were to be realised, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Film_the_most_thrilling_30_second_sequence_wearing_the_wellie_cam\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Film the most thrilling 30 second sequence wearing the wellie cam\">Film the most thrilling 30 second sequence wearing the wellie cam</a> task. The title card is of a welly cam, referencing <a href=\"/wiki/Film_the_most_thrilling_30_second_sequence_wearing_the_welly_cam\" title=\"Film the most thrilling 30 second sequence wearing the welly cam\">Film the most thrilling 30 second sequence wearing the welly cam</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_end_of_the_franchise.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Enden på serien', which translates as 'The end of the series'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Bond-leffojen tuho', which translates as 'The destruction of Bond movies'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Irriterande repeterande kopierande', which translates as 'Annoying repetitive copying'. These Swedish words rhyme, and are referring to the <a href=\"/wiki/Copy_Alex\" title=\"Copy Alex\">Copy Alex</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Slutten på serien', which translates as 'The end of the series'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_end_of_the_franchise.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alan Davies</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Desiree Burch</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Guz Khan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Morgana_Robinson\" title=\"Morgana Robinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Morgana Robinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_old_fashioned_thing_that_you_still_use\" title=\"Most old fashioned thing that you still use\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most old-fashioned thing that you still use.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Copy_Alex\" title=\"Copy Alex\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Copy Alex. Alex will demonstrate his actions twice, then you will have one attempt to copy Alex. Closest copy wins.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_highest_sand_bridge_across_the_river\" title=\"Make the highest sand bridge across the river\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the highest sand bridge across the river. You may not leave the lab. Your sand bridge must support the egg and the egg must be able to pass under the sand bridge.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Most extravagant sand bridge.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Film_the_most_thrilling_30_second_sequence_wearing_the_wellie_cam\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Film the most thrilling 30 second sequence wearing the wellie cam\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Film the most thrilling 30-second sequence wearing the welly-cam.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Correctly_guess_your_teammate%27s_object\" title=\"Correctly guess your teammate&#39;s object\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Correctly guess your teammate's object. Your teammate will represent their object through the medium of shadows on the screen. Fastest correct guess wins two actual points per round.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>21</b>\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Ext